# GEMINI_02 outside review, round 2: vetting (2026-09-24)

The author ran `GEMINI_02_outside_review.md` in Gemini (Antigravity) a second time and pasted the answer in chat.
It reported 11 points: 1 critical, 3 major, 7 minor, and "UNVERIFIED references: none". The citation check
in that line is not trusted: Gemini ran scripts over the files and did not open the cited papers.

